WEBVTT

00:01.470 --> 00:08.420
Satoshi and his friends have come to Frey City so Serena can particpate in the Tripokalon that's going to be held there.

00:01.940 --> 00:11.820
While watching anime, make sure not to sit too close to the screen and that the room is well lit.

00:09.530 --> 00:12.520
I have to get my last Princess Key, no matter what.

00:13.240 --> 00:15.060
Yeah. Go for broke!

00:15.280 --> 00:18.180
You will be fine, Serena. Have confidence in yourself!

00:18.540 --> 00:20.830
He's right. We'll be rooting for you, after all!

00:24.210 --> 00:26.110
Yeah. Thank you, guys!

00:27.940 --> 00:28.880
What is going on?

00:28.880 --> 00:30.090
So many people!

00:33.450 --> 00:36.670
Amelia-san, we're counting on you to get your third Princess Key!

00:36.880 --> 00:39.140
I'm looking forward to the Master Class!

00:39.580 --> 00:42.020
Our city bring forth the new Kalos Queen!

00:42.360 --> 00:43.620
"Kalos Queen"?

00:44.000 --> 00:46.580
Will she be participating in the Tripokalon too?

00:47.010 --> 00:48.520
She's really popular.

01:03.370 --> 01:09.080
The Master Class Trial!
What Will You Do, Serena!?

01:18.930 --> 01:20.220
Serena, aren't you eating anything?

01:22.530 --> 01:23.930
I will now!

01:24.480 --> 01:26.890
If you don't eat till you're full before a fight,

01:27.950 --> 01:29.250
you won't have enough energy for it, after all.

01:29.650 --> 01:31.930
<i>You</i> always eat lots, after all!

01:32.150 --> 01:33.680
That's why you always have so much energy.

01:33.890 --> 01:34.250
Yeah!

01:36.210 --> 01:37.660
This is so like you, Satoshi.

01:44.910 --> 01:46.460
I'm off, then!

01:45.080 --> 01:54.940
Play a board game via the Pocket Monsters XY& data broadcast!
Press the d-button on your remote and try reaching the battles and the presents!!

01:45.080 --> 01:54.940
Z

01:47.120 --> 01:48.480
Do your best, Serena!

01:48.990 --> 01:50.730
We'll be sure to root for you!

01:51.680 --> 01:52.920
Everyone, do your best.

02:04.960 --> 02:05.580
Thank you.

02:05.900 --> 02:07.020
I'll make sure to win!

02:12.270 --> 02:12.960
All right...

02:13.830 --> 02:14.400
Excuse me.

02:15.490 --> 02:17.370
There's not much time until the show starts.

02:17.650 --> 02:18.670
I'm sorry.

02:38.990 --> 02:41.040
All right then, we should get prepared too.

02:43.790 --> 02:45.060
We've been waiting for you.

02:45.730 --> 02:49.600
Your presence alone will build excitement at the venue, Yashio-san.

02:49.750 --> 02:51.950
It is the Perfomers that will build the excitement.

02:51.950 --> 02:53.530
Yes! Of course.

02:53.530 --> 02:57.420
But you see, there's a participant I would like you to meet...

02:57.420 --> 03:03.210
She's the daughter of a prestigious family here in Frey City who has completed lessons in a wide variety of fields with excellent grades;

03:03.210 --> 03:05.990
she'd love if you became her producer...

03:06.380 --> 03:09.480
I only evaluate what I've seen with my own eyes.

03:11.240 --> 03:12.800
U-Uh yeah, of course...

03:13.100 --> 03:17.110
If you could watch her performance, you...

03:24.060 --> 03:25.960
Ladies and gentlemen!

03:27.340 --> 03:28.450
I'm sorry to keep you waiting!

03:28.940 --> 03:33.130
The festival with très bien and charming Pokémon and Performers,

03:33.130 --> 03:37.150
the Frey Tripokalon Rookie Class Tournament, will now begin!

03:39.830 --> 03:42.200
I'm your guide to your dream of love,

03:42.750 --> 03:44.070
Monsieur Pierre!

03:44.950 --> 03:48.400
At the end of this très bien fight between Performers who aim to become Kalos Queen,

03:49.250 --> 03:50.800
the winner...

03:52.010 --> 03:54.580
...will be presented with this Princess Key!

03:59.600 --> 04:02.760
Serena-san, Cal-san, Cazary-san, please.

04:03.290 --> 04:03.520
Yes!

04:03.520 --> 04:03.830
Yes!

04:04.700 --> 04:07.580
And today's theme performance is...

04:07.790 --> 04:08.400
...this!

04:25.480 --> 04:26.560
Sihorn?

04:27.490 --> 04:30.330
Whoa, so many Sihorn!

04:30.330 --> 04:32.330
So cute!

04:31.510 --> 04:33.660
They're going to perform with Sihorn?

04:35.050 --> 04:40.470
A Queen must possess the power to draw Pokémon to her.

04:41.630 --> 04:49.320
The Performers who attracts the highest number of Sihorn to their side within the time limit will proceed to the free performance.

04:49.590 --> 04:51.820
You can use any method you like.

04:52.930 --> 04:53.920
Hey, isn't this...?

04:54.560 --> 04:56.630
Yeah, it's Serena's field of expertise!

04:57.280 --> 04:59.310
But we cannot know what will happen.

04:59.840 --> 05:01.570
She cannot let her guard down before the time is up.

05:01.970 --> 05:04.780
Enter the first group in the theme performance!

05:11.720 --> 05:12.410
It's Serena!

05:12.670 --> 05:13.910
She is up first.

05:14.330 --> 05:15.580
Do your best, Serena!

05:17.670 --> 05:18.580
Well then,

05:19.090 --> 05:20.080
start!

05:24.970 --> 05:27.050
Hey, this way! Come over here!

05:28.050 --> 05:29.720
Dredear, get over to the other side to close them off!

05:42.540 --> 05:44.450
C-Calm down! Okay?

05:47.390 --> 05:51.610
Oh, what's this? The Sihorn are charging towards Performer Serena!

05:52.650 --> 05:53.490
As expected...

05:53.950 --> 05:54.750
You are right.

05:55.790 --> 05:57.290
H-Hey, wait!

05:59.970 --> 06:02.540
As always, Serena is popular with Sihorn.

06:02.860 --> 06:05.710
She's so lucky! I wanna be nuzzled by the Sihorn too...

06:11.710 --> 06:13.420
S-Stop it...!

06:20.470 --> 06:22.270
Dredear, Sweet Scent!

06:26.310 --> 06:27.880
Such good kids... This way!

06:28.110 --> 06:31.190
Cazary has drawn the Sihorn to her with Sweet Scent.

06:33.080 --> 06:33.950
I didn't know you could do that...

06:34.790 --> 06:36.720
There's not much time left!

06:37.400 --> 06:38.790
Sorry, can you let me pass?

06:41.370 --> 06:41.960
Come here.

06:42.750 --> 06:43.870
No wonder you got startled.

06:44.690 --> 06:45.530
It's fine.

06:48.040 --> 06:52.210
Oh, right! The Sihorn at our house likes being touched here.

07:01.370 --> 07:03.130
All right, slowly...

07:09.630 --> 07:10.780
Time's up!

07:11.670 --> 07:14.650
All right, who did the Sihorn love the most...?

07:15.390 --> 07:19.110
Performer Serena, congratulations! You did it!

07:22.490 --> 07:23.280
All right!

07:24.460 --> 07:25.200
Good job!

07:25.200 --> 07:26.040
I expected nothing less!

07:34.590 --> 07:37.500
This is the last group in the theme performance!

07:39.880 --> 07:40.880
Amelia!

07:40.880 --> 07:41.810
Do your best!

07:42.110 --> 07:42.560
Uh...

07:43.410 --> 07:47.760
Since she is a local, this might be a tough fight for Serena.

07:48.410 --> 07:49.320
What?!

07:49.500 --> 07:50.490
Now then, start!

07:51.690 --> 07:53.920
Eifie, Hakuryu, Attract!

07:59.640 --> 08:01.600
All right, everyone! Come here!

08:10.600 --> 08:13.100
The last one to proceed to the free performance is...

08:13.510 --> 08:15.800
...Performer Amelia!

08:19.690 --> 08:20.790
I'm sorry to keep you waiting!

08:21.210 --> 08:25.400
The Performers' love-filled free performances will now begin.

08:26.350 --> 08:29.530
Of course, the judges will be the audience watching over them!

08:30.160 --> 08:32.740
When everyone's performance is finished,

08:32.740 --> 08:38.310
please vote by taking the PokéLume at your seat and lighting it in the same color as the Performer you thought was best.

08:38.880 --> 08:40.370
Here comes the first group.

08:40.800 --> 08:43.510
Come on, Performer Aulas!

08:46.840 --> 08:49.080
Here, you're all ready to go now!

09:05.790 --> 09:08.560
Nymphia, we've all practiced so much, haven't we?

09:13.470 --> 09:14.010
Oh, right!

09:16.400 --> 09:17.330
Do you wanna eat some Pofflés?

09:17.880 --> 09:20.390
Eating will fill you with energy. That's what Satoshi said.

09:21.650 --> 09:23.370
Thank you! Let's do our best!

09:30.640 --> 09:32.060
Nymphia, you have one too.

09:36.370 --> 09:38.930
Nymphia, you're allowed to make mistakes, you know?

09:39.570 --> 09:41.320
What's most important is that you have fun dancing.

09:42.230 --> 09:45.060
Let's show everyone your dance!

09:48.410 --> 09:49.960
Let's have fun putting on our show!

09:53.560 --> 09:55.820
All right, the next Performer is...

09:56.330 --> 09:57.680
...Amelia!

10:01.520 --> 10:02.680
Pokémon Quiz.

10:03.110 --> 10:04.170
The answer is...?

10:15.430 --> 10:16.170
Go!

10:20.200 --> 10:23.810
Eifie, Psychic! Hakuryu, Dragon Dance!

10:36.370 --> 10:38.470
Eifie, Hakuryu, Attract!

10:48.990 --> 10:50.170
Eifie, Rain Dance!

10:57.180 --> 10:59.310
Hakuryu, Ice Beam!

11:05.180 --> 11:06.370
Hyper Voice!

11:14.490 --> 11:15.360
Finish!

11:17.250 --> 11:18.400
So pretty!

11:18.860 --> 11:21.180
I expected nothing less from the favorite.

11:24.600 --> 11:27.610
Oh no! Harimaron got affected by Attract!

11:30.120 --> 11:32.780
We'll continue with Performer Serena!

11:34.990 --> 11:35.740
It's Serena!

11:36.970 --> 11:38.060
Serena!

11:38.060 --> 11:39.670
Calm down, calm down...

11:44.300 --> 11:45.950
Tairenar, Flamethrower!

11:59.980 --> 12:01.150
Fairy Wind!

12:07.410 --> 12:09.210
Yancham, now!

12:21.170 --> 12:22.430
All right, nice!

12:51.070 --> 12:52.570
Serena and her Pokémon seem to be happy.

12:53.080 --> 12:55.420
Yeah, it makes <i>me</i> feel happy too.

12:59.670 --> 13:01.530
All right, let's finish this!

13:21.830 --> 13:22.680
Finish!

13:30.470 --> 13:31.450
It was fun, wasn't it?

13:36.370 --> 13:39.970
Who is the elegant and trés bien winner?

13:40.460 --> 13:46.570
Dear audience, please light your PokéLumes in the same color as the Performer you thought was the most wonderful!

13:47.650 --> 13:48.060
Un,

13:48.430 --> 13:48.760
deux,

13:49.210 --> 13:50.300
trois!

14:11.950 --> 14:16.000
It's decided! The winner of the Frey Tripokalon Tournament is...

14:19.500 --> 14:21.200
...Performer Serena!

14:23.970 --> 14:25.480
All right!

14:25.900 --> 14:26.630
Serena!

14:28.320 --> 14:29.340
All right, all right!

14:35.610 --> 14:41.490
The winner, Performer Serena, will now be given this elegant and beautiful Princess Key!

14:43.610 --> 14:44.700
Ta-da!

14:45.050 --> 14:48.110
I got my last Princess Key!

14:50.370 --> 14:53.560
Congratulations on getting your third Princess Key.

14:53.830 --> 14:57.210
You've now secured the right to enter the Master Class.

14:58.250 --> 14:59.130
We really...

14:59.800 --> 15:00.530
...get to go...

15:17.070 --> 15:18.060
Ta-da!

15:18.520 --> 15:20.060
Congratulations, Serena!

15:20.220 --> 15:20.680
Thanks.

15:21.230 --> 15:22.520
It really feels like a dream.

15:22.940 --> 15:25.750
Being able to stand on the same stage as Elle-san...

15:25.750 --> 15:29.340
It's not a dream. You and her will fight on the same level, as Performers.

15:30.230 --> 15:31.570
As Performers...

15:31.930 --> 15:32.310
That's right.

15:33.040 --> 15:34.070
And so will I!

15:34.530 --> 15:39.260
That's why I'm practicing really hard right now to get a new performance ready for the Master Class!

15:39.920 --> 15:40.460
Yeah.

15:40.890 --> 15:42.290
I won't fall behind either!

15:43.170 --> 15:44.630
Serena, everything's ready!

15:45.840 --> 15:47.050
I'll see you, Sana.

15:47.490 --> 15:47.870
Yeah!

15:48.170 --> 15:50.510
Hurry, hurry! It's awesome!

15:51.390 --> 15:53.910
Eureka, don't rush!

15:56.010 --> 15:58.850
This is to celebrate your advance to the Master Class.

15:59.250 --> 16:00.550
Amazing!

16:02.080 --> 16:03.930
Did you make this, Citron?

16:03.930 --> 16:06.360
Yes! Please eat as much as you like!

16:07.290 --> 16:10.650
I have made special Pokémon Food for Tairenar and the others as well.

16:14.510 --> 16:16.060
There is enough for everyone.

16:16.880 --> 16:17.920
All right!

16:23.230 --> 16:27.680
I got a bit nervous after all, but thanks to your cheering I made it!

16:37.240 --> 16:39.760
Tairenar, Yancham, Nymphia,

16:40.200 --> 16:41.670
I'll groom you now!

16:44.710 --> 16:45.270
Huh?

16:51.470 --> 16:53.050
Are you sure it's this one?

16:53.490 --> 16:54.410
Yes.

16:55.070 --> 16:56.460
Thank you very much!

16:56.460 --> 16:57.040
Don't mention it.

16:59.450 --> 17:01.490
All right, let's head back and get you groomed.

17:04.640 --> 17:05.520
Please wait!

17:06.360 --> 17:07.560
I can't accept this!

17:10.410 --> 17:14.130
I'm sure my performance was more refined than that girl's!

17:14.730 --> 17:15.230
That's...

17:17.660 --> 17:19.220
But you lost.

17:19.670 --> 17:22.130
That was how the audience evaluated it, right?

17:24.300 --> 17:27.360
I don't think this is the kind of thing you should be doing right now, am I wrong?

17:28.110 --> 17:29.020
But I...

17:29.560 --> 17:31.820
I want to surpass Elle as a Performer!

17:34.650 --> 17:36.460
A mere perfect score won't make you win.

17:37.510 --> 17:40.760
It is up to you yourself to achieve something even greater than that.

17:50.720 --> 17:51.250
You!

17:52.750 --> 17:54.050
What are you doing there?

17:54.570 --> 17:56.140
Oh, I'm sorry!

17:56.510 --> 17:58.940
I didn't mean to eavesdrop...

17:58.940 --> 18:00.050
Did the way you performed today...

18:00.910 --> 18:03.060
...make you personally satisfied?

18:09.580 --> 18:10.980
I think we all had fun!

18:15.680 --> 18:16.110
So?

18:17.600 --> 18:18.440
Is that all?

18:20.770 --> 18:23.870
You're lacking something that's absolutely crucial for becoming Queen.

18:25.850 --> 18:29.250
As long as you don't realize what it is, you can't win against Elle.

18:42.620 --> 18:44.270
Yeah, I'm fine.

18:44.790 --> 18:45.510
Let's go back.

18:54.970 --> 18:56.840
Something I'm lacking...

19:03.240 --> 19:09.480
And with that, the winner of the Frey Tripokalon Rookie Class Tournament is Performer Serena!

19:09.880 --> 19:13.180
Let's have très bien expectations for her future success.

19:13.180 --> 19:15.900
Awesome! They showed you a lot on the screen, Serena!

19:15.280 --> 19:19.180
Also, the venue for the long-awaited Tripokalon Master Class...

19:16.400 --> 19:16.890
Yeah.

19:19.530 --> 19:21.330
...has been decided!

19:21.330 --> 19:22.220
Oh, where is it?

19:23.040 --> 19:24.880
The place where magnificent maidens will gather...

19:25.120 --> 19:26.850
...is Glorio City!

19:27.310 --> 19:30.980
Look forward to elegant and exciting performances.

19:32.450 --> 19:33.640
Glorio City, huh?

19:36.530 --> 19:38.530
It's a little way off from the Eisetsu Gym.

19:40.480 --> 19:41.570
Now that we know where to go,

19:42.240 --> 19:44.120
let's set off for Glorio City!

19:44.960 --> 19:45.820
Satoshi...

19:47.350 --> 19:48.930
Serena, wait!

19:49.280 --> 19:50.510
Hurry, hurry!

19:51.800 --> 19:55.430
We do not need to hurry, Glorio City will not run away!

19:55.720 --> 19:57.550
Citron, hurry!

19:58.440 --> 19:59.890
Wondering what she meant won't get us anywhere.

20:00.430 --> 20:02.410
Right now, I need to move forward!

20:03.370 --> 20:07.920
Serena has got her third Princess Key and her ticket to the Master Class.

20:08.750 --> 20:12.060
Even though she still has things to work on, her efforts to become Kalos Queen are...

20:16.030 --> 20:20.990
Sunday February 28th at 8am!

20:16.560 --> 20:18.400
What are you <i>doing?</i>

20:16.840 --> 20:20.310
In the next Pokénchi episode, Abareru-kun rampages as always!

20:18.670 --> 20:20.600
No! Don't!

20:23.380 --> 20:25.160
Performer News!

20:26.390 --> 20:30.710
This show roots for the Pokémon Performers that dream of their future.

20:30.980 --> 20:33.210
It is presented to you by me, Takuro, and...

20:33.210 --> 20:34.340
...me, Yajiko!

20:34.340 --> 20:37.160
Look, look! Isn't this girl with the pigtails cute?!

20:37.160 --> 20:39.050
You're right. You've made another discovery.

20:39.050 --> 20:43.010
I know, right?! Look, this Fushigidane-chan is also too cute!

20:43.010 --> 20:44.520
Oh my, I want to take it home with me!

20:44.520 --> 20:48.820
Her teamwork with Flabebe-chan is also the greatest! She's just like a fairy!

20:48.820 --> 20:51.510
Oh, I want to dance like that too!

20:51.510 --> 20:53.200
You wouldn't be a fairy, you'd be a monster...

20:53.200 --> 20:55.670
Sheesh! I'll use Seismic Toss on you for that!

20:55.670 --> 20:57.370
No way!

20:57.870 --> 20:58.040
All right, finally, we'll present what we've chosen to be the best clothing match this time!

21:01.790 --> 21:03.330
Today, it's this little Pokémon!

21:04.730 --> 21:07.130
It's Masked Pikachu!

21:12.820 --> 21:15.400
Oh my, it's paralyzing!

21:18.260 --> 21:20.100
All right, everyone! Let's go together!

21:20.330 --> 21:21.390
Towards our next adventure!

21:22.820 --> 21:27.310
I have always wanted to go to the Thunder Festival, the festival dedicated to Electric Pokémon, one day!

21:27.490 --> 21:29.210
Wow, what kind of festival is it?

21:29.480 --> 21:32.120
In ancient times, a large thunderbolt Thunder sent down...

21:32.120 --> 21:33.590
Bro, look at that!

21:33.590 --> 21:34.180
Whoa!

21:35.940 --> 21:36.450
That's...!

21:37.040 --> 21:39.600
Next time on Pocket Monsters XY&Z:

21:39.780 --> 21:42.440
Thunder and Onvern! A Furious Strike of Lightning!!

21:42.440 --> 21:45.940
Next Time

21:42.440 --> 21:45.940
Thunder and Onvern!
A Furious Strike of Lightning!!

21:42.630 --> 21:44.610
Everyone, get Pokémon!

21:45.940 --> 21:45.950
Next episode:

21:45.940 --> 21:45.950
The legendary Pokémon Thunder strikes!

21:46.850 --> 21:51.430
Pocket Monsters XY&Z was brought to you by these sponsors.

21:50.980 --> 21:55.980
Onbat's bravery saves everyone!!
